[Governor Sato] Yes! There are so many recommendations in Oita! First of all, the hot springs! Oita Prefecture ranks number one in the country for both the number of hot spring sources and output! Besides that, there's Seki horse mackerel, Seki mackerel, Kabosu yellowtail, Oita Wagyu beef, karaage, and so much more culinary appeal. We definitely want everyone to taste them!

